>Holt</surname><given-names>SC</given-names></name><name><surname>Barbour</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name></person-group><year>1991</year><article-title>A flagella-less mutant of <italic>Borrelia burgdorferi</italic>. Structural, molecular, and <italic>in vitro</italic> functional characterization.</article-title><source>J Clin Invest</source><volume>88</volume><fpage>82</fpage><lpage>92</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2056133</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ppat.1000090-Thomas4"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Comstock</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><year>1989</year><article-title>Interaction of Lyme disease spirochetes with cultured eucaryotic cells.</article-title><source>Infect Immun</source><volume>57</volume><fpage>1324</fpage><lpage>1326</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2925254</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ppat.1000090-Szczepanski1"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Szczepanski</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Furie</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Benach</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Lane</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Fleit</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><year>1990</year><article-title>Interaction between <italic>Borrelia burgdorferi</italic> and endothelium <italic>in vitro</italic>.</article-title><source>J Clin Invest</source><volume>85</volume><fpage>1637</fpage><lpage>1647</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2332509</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ppat.1000090-Ma1"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ma</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Sturrock</surname><given-na